1
00:05:33,370 --> 00:06:06,240
A prayer reaching the distant sky, tears flowing like droplets

2
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:12,640
I found a warmth that wraps around me without hesitation

3
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:18,860
Words as pure as white snow, honest to the very end

4
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:25,320
Moving me, clad in wings of iron

5
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:31,080
Each time I'm hurt, I grow a little kinder

6
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:40,320
There's only one wish I want to protect with you

7
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:46,360
Memories of sorrow carved across time

8
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:52,970
All because of your light that receives them head-on

9
00:06:52,970 --> 00:06:58,410
The eternal flame that lit up in my heart that day

10
00:06:58,410 --> 00:07:06,220
Released into the deep mountains, opening the door to freedom

11
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:23,300
A strong, endless future

12
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:29,860
The shadow of my heart cast upon the cold green moon

13
00:07:29,860 --> 00:07:36,200
I whispered quietly — I want to be by your side

14
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:42,440
The courage you gave me to face the truth

15
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:49,000
Races through me, awakening me to my dreams

16
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:54,590
So that these feelings we share never drift apart

17
00:07:54,590 --> 00:08:03,950
Soaring through the scolding, carrying a certain conviction

18
00:08:03,950 --> 00:08:09,770
A blank page raised high above a golden sea

19
00:08:09,770 --> 00:08:16,070
Only you know — show me what's real

20
00:08:16,070 --> 00:08:22,490
A vow born from the raging heartache

21
00:08:22,490 --> 00:08:25,910
I'm not afraid of anything anymore

22
00:08:25,910 --> 00:08:31,920
Without averting the stolen gaze

23
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:46,240
Beginning what matters most, right now

24
00:08:46,240 --> 00:09:45,700
Shattering the memories of sorrow

25
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:49,440
Receiving them head-on

26
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:52,350
The warrior of your light

27
00:09:52,350 --> 00:09:57,960
The eternal flame that lit up in my heart that day

28
00:09:57,960 --> 00:10:01,620
Released into the deep darkness

29
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:08,070
Opening the door to freedom

30
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:25,770
Strong and endless — surely carrying on from here

31
00:10:25,770 --> 00:30:47,230
Continuing to carry on — collision, collision

32
00:30:47,230 --> 00:30:52,610
Loss is absolute, so hold on to it

33
00:30:52,610 --> 00:32:01,050
An impulse that makes your heart leap with excitement

34
00:32:01,050 --> 00:32:06,250
You need me, don't you?

35
00:32:06,250 --> 00:32:43,870
Tonight I'll set you ablaze

36
00:32:43,870 --> 00:32:49,290
A miracle I don't believe in

37
00:32:49,290 --> 00:32:53,830
What cuts through is the flame of the phoenix

38
00:32:53,830 --> 00:32:57,110
Unraveling your poison

39
00:32:57,110 --> 00:33:02,290
High, high — show me the light at your side

40
00:33:02,290 --> 00:33:06,100
Flashback, flashback — I won't forgive

41
00:33:06,100 --> 00:33:08,640
It's a race — keep moving forward

42
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:13,630
Until it runs out — no matter what

43
00:33:13,630 --> 00:34:27,380
With the flame of the undying phoenix — keep challenging

44
00:34:27,380 --> 00:34:32,640
Flashback, flashback — show me the light at your side

45
00:34:32,640 --> 00:34:39,300
Surely, keep moving forward together

46
00:56:36,470 --> 00:56:39,210
Congratulations!

47
00:56:39,210 --> 00:56:41,210
That's the flow of things so far!

48
00:56:41,210 --> 00:56:43,010
Together with the merch—

49
00:56:43,010 --> 00:56:44,810
The merch, right—

50
00:56:44,810 --> 00:56:47,650
I'd like to introduce it to you!

51
00:56:47,650 --> 00:56:49,650
Everyone, please react as you see fit!

52
00:56:49,650 --> 00:56:51,650
Thank you so much!

53
00:56:51,650 --> 00:56:53,650
Congratulations!

54
00:56:53,650 --> 00:57:02,250
The birthday commemorative merch lineup

55
00:57:02,250 --> 00:57:04,050
is all here!

56
00:57:04,050 --> 00:57:05,850
Huh?

57
00:57:05,850 --> 00:57:07,650
Wait, that—

58
00:57:07,650 --> 00:57:09,650
Huh? Huh?

59
00:57:09,650 --> 00:57:11,650
Something's a little—

60
00:57:11,650 --> 00:57:13,150
I don't have it!

61
00:57:13,150 --> 00:57:14,050
I do have it!

62
00:57:14,050 --> 00:57:17,450
Alright then, let's go through them one by one!

63
00:57:17,450 --> 00:57:17,950
Yes!

64
00:57:17,950 --> 00:57:19,860
First up, this one!

65
00:57:19,860 --> 00:57:23,970
It's Polka's very first dakimakura cover!

66
00:57:23,970 --> 00:57:25,770
Wow, it's so cute!

67
00:57:25,770 --> 00:57:27,570
Wait, isn't she wearing some kind of loungewear?

68
00:57:27,570 --> 00:57:28,970
Isn't that the Marine outfit?

69
00:57:28,970 --> 00:57:30,470
No no no, wait, you're right!

70
00:57:30,470 --> 00:57:32,080
Hey, that's her room wear!

71
00:57:32,080 --> 00:57:33,080
Oh, it is room wear!

72
00:57:33,080 --> 00:57:35,060
I mean, Nene and the others wear this kind of room wear too—

73
00:57:35,060 --> 00:57:35,680
Huh?

74
00:57:35,680 --> 00:57:37,880
I'm talking about Nene and them!

75
00:57:37,880 --> 00:57:39,680
No no no no no no!

76
00:57:39,680 --> 00:57:40,760
Stay, stay, stay!

77
00:57:40,760 --> 00:57:43,360
Just because it's someone else's channel, you're doing whatever you want!

78
00:57:43,360 --> 00:57:45,060
Hey, if you sleep in a shirt it'll get wrinkled!

79
00:57:45,060 --> 00:57:46,680
Hey, stop it, seriously!

80
00:57:46,680 --> 00:57:49,700
It might just be for the photo shoot!

81
00:57:49,700 --> 00:57:50,340
I see, makes sense.

82
00:57:50,340 --> 00:57:52,580
So, for the first time ever, we're releasing a dakimakura cover!

83
00:57:52,580 --> 00:57:55,800
The front has the regular outfit, and the back has the Karen shirt.

84
00:57:55,800 --> 00:57:58,560
So cute!

85
00:57:58,560 --> 00:58:00,140
Thank you~

86
00:58:00,140 --> 00:58:01,460
Next one!

87
00:58:01,460 --> 00:58:02,600
Thank you, dead center shot!

88
00:58:02,600 --> 00:58:04,180
Next up — ta-da!

89
00:58:04,180 --> 00:58:07,840
These are Polka random rubber straps featuring all her past outfits!

90
00:58:07,840 --> 00:58:09,640
So cute!

91
00:58:09,640 --> 00:58:11,640
Rubber straps of all the outfits so far!

92
00:58:11,640 --> 00:58:14,440
These were illustrated by Mememe-sensei!

93
00:58:14,440 --> 00:58:16,440
Adorable!

94
00:58:16,440 --> 00:58:17,440
Something to look forward to!

95
00:58:17,440 --> 00:58:20,440
Thank you, everyone — your reactions are literally a perfect score!

96
00:58:20,440 --> 00:58:23,440
And next, this one!

97
00:58:23,440 --> 00:58:24,240
What's that?

98
00:58:24,240 --> 00:58:26,840
This is also a Memories & Treasures Binder!

99
00:58:26,840 --> 00:58:27,840
Nice!

100
00:58:27,840 --> 00:58:32,840
Lately a lot of members have been releasing cheki-style bromide cards as bonuses, so

101
00:58:32,840 --> 00:58:33,840
you can put those kinds of things in here,

102
00:58:33,840 --> 00:58:35,840
and it's also sized to fit holo cards,

103
00:58:35,840 --> 00:58:39,220
— Perfect! — So please fill it with all kinds of memories~

104
00:58:39,220 --> 00:58:40,920
— Bring it on! — Bring it on, fill it up~

105
00:58:40,920 --> 00:58:44,030
Yes, and next up is this!

106
00:58:44,030 --> 00:58:47,120
— A Polka tail keychain! — Aww, so cute!

107
00:58:47,120 --> 00:58:48,920
They're trending again, going full circle!

108
00:58:48,920 --> 00:58:51,220
— It's a keychain shaped like Polka's tail! — For sure, for sure!

109
00:58:51,220 --> 00:58:56,760
— Kind of a Heisei retro vibe? — Yes, it has that Heisei retro feel!

110
00:58:56,760 --> 00:58:59,140
Please attach it to something~

111
00:58:59,140 --> 00:59:01,550
And there's also a voice pack — here it is!

112
00:59:01,550 --> 00:59:04,300
— Ta-da, it's an ASMR voice! — Is it Heisei-style?

113
00:59:04,300 --> 00:59:12,660
Well, it's kind of like a Polka's scenario thing — even the title is a bit on the nose, isn't it!

114
00:59:12,660 --> 00:59:20,620
Aaahh, I had a moment of "why did I invite my gen-mates today" — now I'm embarrassed!

115
00:59:20,620 --> 00:59:23,900
Right now it's set during New Year's.

116
00:59:23,900 --> 00:59:32,860
So it's an ASMR scenario that ties together the dakimakura cover and the illustration.

117
00:59:32,860 --> 00:59:41,870
This cheki-style bromide card comes with a handwritten message for a limited quantity,

118
00:59:41,870 --> 00:59:44,750
and the regular version has a box-press replica signature.

119
00:59:44,750 --> 00:59:50,110
The standard edition comes with a box-press replica signature and a message.

120
00:59:50,110 --> 00:59:53,010
For those who purchase the full set,

121
00:59:53,010 --> 00:59:55,970
as a bonus voice you'll get a sleepy Polka

122
00:59:55,970 --> 00:59:57,070
sleep-together voice —

123
00:59:57,070 --> 01:00:03,190
kind of like "let's go to sleep together" vibes.

124
01:00:03,190 --> 01:00:08,430
That one is also ASMR-style.

125
01:00:08,430 --> 01:00:13,570
I'm so embarrassed — and everyone's here watching!

126
01:00:13,570 --> 01:00:15,890
I've turned into some kind of lewd woman...

127
01:00:15,890 --> 01:00:22,750
Sorry, sorry! Happy New Year everyone, please keep supporting me going forward!

128
01:00:22,750 --> 01:00:28,050
So today I called everyone here so we can all sing together at the end — let's get ready!

129
01:00:28,050 --> 01:00:56,870
Together!

130
01:01:00,630 --> 01:02:06,410
Hotter than passion, an étude at the mercy of the weather

131
01:02:06,410 --> 01:02:44,000
Like an emotional blaze — shout it out, feeling's at its peak!

132
01:02:44,000 --> 01:02:49,000
Shout it out, feeling's at its peak!

133
01:02:49,000 --> 01:02:55,000
Is it over? Is it over?

134
01:02:55,000 --> 01:03:20,360
Wanting to say "don't let go"...

135
01:03:20,360 --> 01:03:26,730
That'd just weigh you down, wouldn't it?

136
01:03:26,730 --> 01:03:32,510
Someday let's write our epilogue together

137
01:03:32,510 --> 01:03:35,840
It's a promise, for sure

138
01:03:35,840 --> 01:03:39,410
Live go zone — let's go see what kind of future awaits!

139
01:03:39,410 --> 01:03:41,740
How free we are — it makes me laugh!

140
01:03:41,740 --> 01:03:44,620
Hey, more than any hologram,

141
01:03:44,620 --> 01:03:55,790
the spotlight of your life —

142
01:03:55,790 --> 01:04:10,470
right here is the best seat in the house
